{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath Kemeranth, the <strong>Kesiksarn\u0131\u00e7</strong> echoes. A light once known for quiet warmth\u2014<strong>LUXVYR</strong>\u2014is marked as \u201cdanger\u201d by the council\u2019s ice sorcerer, <strong>Ayazoth</strong>, and driven into a trap of stone and rumor.<br>Six rooms hold six voices\u2014gratitude, duty, doubt, fear, cold reason, and hope. As their fragments align, doors woven from lies begin to loosen; beneath the stone, a human voice remains.<br><br><strong>LUXVYR</strong> is an atmospheric <strong>stealth\u2013escape</strong> game. While the ice sorcerer <strong>Ayazoth</strong> tracks you by <strong>sight and sound</strong>, you manage the <strong>risk\u2013reward</strong> of light in a dark labyrinth and open <strong>\u201cnarrative doors\u201d</strong> by gathering <strong>Echo/Witness</strong> fragments.<br><strong>Goal:</strong> hide, shake the pursuit, solve the doors, and find the exit.<br><i>\u201cThe labyrinth opens not with a key, but with witness.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth &amp; pursuit:</strong> Ayazoth searches for you via line of sight and sound.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light mechanic:</strong> Light offers safety but increases visibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witness progression:</strong> Collected fragments unlock doors and new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alternate escapes:</strong> Multiple routes and solutions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo:</strong> Target window <strong>October 2025</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005160?t=1757691118","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005160?t=1757691118","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_